* Chunk naming: use a recovery step when an item may no longer be available in working memory.
Goal: Find a previously named list item
. Goal: Acquire item name
.. Hear <budget report>
. Goal: Perform an intervening task
.. Look at <notifications>
.. Search for <unread notification>
.. Read <unread notification>
. Goal: Recover item name
.. Say What was the item name
.. Hear <budget report>
. Goal: Find item
.. Search for <budget report>
.. Look at <budget report>
.. Touch <budget report>
.. Verify <budget report> is open
